      ],
      "sha256": "d73313ac6440be233e28b62ffc37d8ebe33c58a90d4f38491f34d0c2f3910caa",
      "kind": "figure",
      "alt": "Figure 8. Four outlined groups in a timeline cluster edits by both time distance horizontally and code-line distance vertically. Group 1 contains a long descending run of edits; groups 2–4 contain shorter nearby clusters. The lower panel aligns code annotations horizontally within a group, preserving indentation and helping reveal the code's structure and scope."
    },
    {
