      "sha256": "018506ee59c3c03efd0c191304c06112c88985e497fb3bc1576ddfadc26eba8c",
      "kind": "formula",
      "alt": "F-score equals two times true positives divided by the sum of two times true positives, false positives, and false negatives."
    },
    {
