      "sha256": "3915858aea734b1b7aeb46b51121f29f6067feba8bcd67a5fc656bfaf18772db",
      "kind": "figure",
      "alt": "Figure 10. Survey comparison of CodeStream and the baseline. The seven ratings run from 1 (strongly prefer CodeStream) through 4 (neutral) to 7 (strongly prefer baseline). Counts for ratings 1–7 are: identifying students who might need help, 2, 2, 4, 3, 1, 0, 0; interpreting students' intentions behind code changes, 3, 3, 1, 5, 0, 0, 0; navigating and exploring coding histories, 4, 4, 1, 1, 1, 0, 1; less effort to understand coding history, 5, 2, 2, 1, 1, 0, 1. Each question has 12 responses and favors CodeStream overall."
    },
